{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110245","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110245/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110245/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110245/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110245","id":3382228120,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6mxyb5","number":110245,"title":"Make minimum drag distance configurable for gui elements","user":{"login":"Armynator","id":5256247,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNTYyNDc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5256247?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Armynator","html_url":"https://github.com/Armynator","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Armynator/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Armynator/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Armynator/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Armynator/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Armynator/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Armynator/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Armynator/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Armynator/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Armynator/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330068,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2OA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/feature%20proposal","name":"feature proposal","color":"4466ff","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518733,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg3MzM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/usability","name":"usability","color":"447744","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","number":23,"title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2978,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-05-22T16:25:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T16:23:23Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-01-26T18:09:14Z"},"comments":4,"created_at":"2025-09-04T05:41:30Z","updated_at":"2025-10-27T15:09:29Z","closed_at":"2025-10-27T15:06:22Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110245","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110245","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110245.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110245.patch","merged_at":"2025-10-27T15:06:21Z"},"body":"The minimum mouse drag distance for gui elements is currently hardcoded to 10, making it feel quite unresponsive to me. In Unity it's 5 by default and can be configured. Today I've learned that [I'm not the only one having issues with it](https://godotforums.org/d/42672-how-to-reduce-drag-distance), making me wonder if there was a reason to hardcode it in the first place?\r\n\r\nThis PR turns it into a project setting, keeping the default value at 10. Also it's only used when running the game, so the editor behavior doesn't change even when adjusting the value.\r\n\r\nIt might be more useful to make this configurable per-viewport, but this version seems easier to use and understand.\r\n(In Unity it's set in the EventSystem class (pixelDragThreshold), which usually only exists once in the scene as well)\r\n\r\n<details><summary>In my specific case it allows me to use a TabBar also as a drag panel header for a scripted game window without feeling unresponsive</summary>\r\n<p>\r\n\r\nDefault behavior (drag distance 10, window drag script distance 6):\r\n\r\n[drag_10.webm](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/32ecd748-5866-45c7-8ef1-169437676a5a)\r\n\r\n(The window gets dragged for a moment as the NOTIFICATION_DRAG_BEGIN isn't fired by the TabBar yet)\r\n\r\nSetting minimum drag distance to 5 (window drag script distance still 6): \r\n\r\n[drag_5.webm](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3c3e67f4-e8bd-4199-b5cd-fd0ee1f5f5af)\r\n\r\n(NOTIFICATION_DRAG_BEGIN is fired sooner, blocking the window movement script until NOTIFICATION_DRAG_END)\r\n</p>\r\n</details> \r\n\r\nAnd I assume there are more use cases for this, as you can do quite a few things with the integrated drag & drop system...","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110245/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":5,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110245/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}